          "text": "林先生，店主同意了。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "h25-verify-03",
          "speakerId": "ning",
          "text": "不过按照店里的保密要求，还需要先核对几项信息。麻烦您通过左侧的新私聊与店主联系。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        }
      ],
      "nextNodeId": "H25_B_SYSTEM_ENTRY",
      "legacyMessages": [
        {
          "messageId": "h25-verify-02",
